This directory holds the compiled single-page application, which web/embed.go
embeds into the binary.

It is committed empty on purpose: //go:embed fails outright on a missing
directory, so without this placeholder `go build ./...` would not work on a
fresh clone until someone had run `npm run build` in web/. The real contents
are produced by that command, or by the web stage of the Dockerfile, and are
git-ignored.
